      "message": "presumably this is a _static inline_ to avoid function calls in a sensitive performance path, so doing this call kinda defeats the purpose. How about we only do this call if there is an attached handler:\n```\n   if (trace_android_rvh_f2fs_down_read_enabled())\n       _trace_android_rvh_f2fs_down_read(\u0026sem-\u003eread_waiters, \u0026sem-\u003einternal_rwsem, \u0026skip);\n```\nthe _enabled test is done inline so this eliminates any function call in the case where no handler is attached.",
