      "writtenOn": "2024-10-15T11:22:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1, For new hook is added here to handle more issues on slowpath, while the existing hooks in __down_read_trylock() can not satisfy;\n2, f2fs_down_read has special logic than other rwsem locks.\nFor macro \u0027CONFIG_F2FS_UNFAIR_RWSEM\u003dy\u0027, f2fs_down_read() will enter slowpath with wait_event where has no hooks anymore.",
